# Deny by default, then allow. Nothing is committed unless it is named below.
#
# The usual way round (list what to ignore) fails open: a file added later that nobody remembers
# to ignore gets published. This directory holds submission correspondence, a named reviewer list
# and project strategy, so it fails closed instead. Adding a file to the public repository is a
# deliberate act of editing this file.
#
# `git status --ignored` shows what is being held back. `git ls-files` shows what will ship.

*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ top level
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/pyproject.toml
!/ruff.toml
!/PREREGISTRATION.md
!/CITATION.cff

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ the package and the analysis
!/src/
/src/*
!/src/specurve/
/src/specurve/*
!/src/specurve/*.py

!/src/analyze.py
!/src/data.py
!/src/ectopic_case.py
!/src/estimate_cost.py
!/src/figure_ectopic.py
!/src/figure_length.py
!/src/figures.py
!/src/interactions.py
!/src/length_control.py
!/src/mfdfa.py
!/src/preprocess.py
!/src/replicate.py
!/src/resources.py
!/src/run_grid.py
!/src/specs.py
!/src/synthetic.py
!/src/figure_synthetic.py
# NOT src/make_refs.py, make_docx.py, make_docx.js, make_manuscript.py: manuscript tooling, and
# the only files in src/ carrying a personal Zotero library id, email address and ORCID.

!/tests/
/tests/*
!/tests/*.py
# NOT tests/test_prose.py: it drives the manuscript scanners, which are not published
# either, and its docstrings carry editorial correspondence.
/tests/test_prose.py

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ results a reader can check
# Summaries, per-specification effect tables, the variance and interaction decompositions and the
# length ladder: about 5 MB, enough to verify every number in sections 3 to 5 with no refitting.
# The raw per-fit grids (results/*.parquet, 70 MB) are regenerable from src/ in about 2.5 CPU
# hours and go in the Zenodo deposit rather than here.
!/results/
/results/*
!/results/*.csv
!/results/*.json
